\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"object-detection\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"d8f0c895-ee07-49f3-8f98-db5d5e1d91a7","tool_call_id":"call_ed14f4aa59524cd98439fabf","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/59e3d0df-6938-4ef5-acc1-9ce422b61d3b/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/59e3d0df-6938-4ef5-acc1-9ce422b61d3b/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/59e3d0df-6938-4ef5-acc1-9ce422b61d3b/user-data/outputs"},"title":"Traffic Video Object Detection","artifacts":[],"uploaded_files":[{"filename":"Trafic.mp4","size":75965424,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","extension":".mp4"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","normalized_query":"检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、轿车、公交车和卡车","输出形式":"每帧的位置框、类别和置信度"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_c378cc","text":"检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_2c4cc5","text":"针对输入视频文件，启用视频解析与逐帧读取能力，依据视频编码标准与帧率参数完成解码与时间戳对齐，校验目标类别在画面中的可见度，预期产出标准化帧序列及帧索引映射表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_405841","text":"基于视频监控场景的多目标检测模型，对标准化帧序列执行推理任务，采用预设的置信度过滤口径与非极大值抑制算法处理行人、轿车、公交车和卡车的空间定位，预期产出原始检测结果集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_61bd8f","text":"对原始检测结果集开展结构化后处理，将边界框坐标统一换算至图像像素坐标系，按帧号聚类聚合同类目标信息，严格核对类别标签与置信度数值精度，预期产出符合规范的单帧检测数据字典。"},{"task_span_id":"span_5e9f43","text":"结合监控任务交付标准，将聚合后的检测数据字典批量导出为指定格式的表格或结构化数组，执行字段完整性校验与跨帧逻辑一致性检查，预期产出带可溯源标识的最终检测结果报告。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_00b4b9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、轿车、公交车和卡车","输出形式":"每帧的位置框、类别和置信度"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_00b4b9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、轿车、公交车和卡车","输出形式":"每帧的位置框、类别和置信度"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:73984091-ddb3-4409-8dba-e0ed94548dfc"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-