时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"object-detection\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"d8f0c895-ee07-49f3-8f98-db5d5e1d91a7","tool_call_id":"call_ed14f4aa59524cd98439fabf","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":73,"prompt_tokens":14653,"total_tokens":14726,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":13,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":73},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":14653}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-92b7c64b-8d45-9415-85ae-ecb7f3f8844e","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8e6f-a5f8-7aa0-9a81-78a80acc3f9e-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取目标检测技能说明文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/object-detection/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_885eeca9af0948ba82941839","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":14653,"output_tokens":73,"total_tokens":14726,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":13}}},{"content":"---\nname: object-detection\ndescription: Detect visible objects in sampled video frames and return standard Detection schema only. Use when Codex needs YOLO labels, confidences, and bounding boxes for people, vehicles, or COCO objects. Do not use this skill to infer events, abnormal behavior, accidents, fights, falls, congestion, intrusion, smoke/fire, or business semantics.\n---\n\n# Object Detection\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf `frames` are missing but the user provided a video path or upload, call `frame-sampling/scripts/run.py` to generate `frames`, then call this skill. If `labels` are missing, use explicit object labels from the user when available; otherwise default to common monitoring labels such as `person,car,bus,truck,motorcycle,bicycle`.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython object-detection/scripts/run.py --frames-json <frames.json> --labels person,car --provider ultralytics --config <config.json> --output <detections.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--input`, `--frames-json`, `--labels`, `--provider`, `--model-path`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read frames and target labels.\n2. Load the configured ultralytics YOLO detector for real inference. The mock provider is disabled and must not be used for chain tests.\n3. Map model labels to internal labels.\n4. Apply per-label confidence thresholds.\n5. Return frame-level Detection records.\n\nYOLO is only an object detector in this project. It must not decide whether a fight, fall, accident, congestion, intrusion, illegal occupation, smoke/fire, or any other event occurred.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `frames`\n- `labels`\n- Optional `detections` to pass through precomputed results\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `detections`, each with `frame_id`, `timestamp`, and `objects` containing `object_id`, `label`, `confidence`, `bbox`, and optional `model_label`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `YOLO_DEPENDENCY_MISSING`\n- `YOLO_MODEL_LOAD_FAILED`\n- `YOLO_MODEL_NOT_FOUND`\n- `YOLO_INFERENCE_FAILED`\n- `FRAME_NOT_FOUND`\n- `MOCK_PROVIDER_DISABLED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not infer business events, abnormal behavior, track identities, ROI occupancy, review routing, or evidence.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"942c9d5e-b515-4b3f-8cf9-570f37c09194","tool_call_id":"call_885eeca9af0948ba82941839","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/59e3d0df-6938-4ef5-acc1-9ce422b61d3b/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/59e3d0df-6938-4ef5-acc1-9ce422b61d3b/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/59e3d0df-6938-4ef5-acc1-9ce422b61d3b/user-data/outputs"},"title":"Traffic Video Object Detection","artifacts":[],"uploaded_files":[{"filename":"Trafic.mp4","size":75965424,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","extension":".mp4"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","normalized_query":"检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、轿车、公交车和卡车","输出形式":"每帧的位置框、类别和置信度"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_c378cc","text":"检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_2c4cc5","text":"针对输入视频文件，启用视频解析与逐帧读取能力，依据视频编码标准与帧率参数完成解码与时间戳对齐，校验目标类别在画面中的可见度，预期产出标准化帧序列及帧索引映射表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_405841","text":"基于视频监控场景的多目标检测模型，对标准化帧序列执行推理任务，采用预设的置信度过滤口径与非极大值抑制算法处理行人、轿车、公交车和卡车的空间定位，预期产出原始检测结果集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_61bd8f","text":"对原始检测结果集开展结构化后处理，将边界框坐标统一换算至图像像素坐标系，按帧号聚类聚合同类目标信息，严格核对类别标签与置信度数值精度，预期产出符合规范的单帧检测数据字典。"},{"task_span_id":"span_5e9f43","text":"结合监控任务交付标准，将聚合后的检测数据字典批量导出为指定格式的表格或结构化数组，执行字段完整性校验与跨帧逻辑一致性检查，预期产出带可溯源标识的最终检测结果报告。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_00b4b9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、轿车、公交车和卡车","输出形式":"每帧的位置框、类别和置信度"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_00b4b9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、轿车、公交车和卡车","输出形式":"每帧的位置框、类别和置信度"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:73984091-ddb3-4409-8dba-e0ed94548dfc"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n检测这段视频里的行人、轿车、公交车和卡车，输出每帧的位置框、类别和置信度。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:73984091-ddb3-4409-8dba-e0ed94548dfc"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

